# Backend (FastAPI)

## Structure
- Routes: `backend/app/api/routes/` — thin handlers only
- Logic: `backend/app/services/` — DB, LLM, classifier, assessment
- Config: `backend/app/config.py` via `.env`
- Constants: `backend/app/core/constants.py` (MH classes, crisis keywords, helplines)

## New endpoints
1. Add route in `app/api/routes/*.py`
2. Register router in `app/main.py` under prefix `/api/v1`
3. Document in `backend/API_COMPLETE_TEST_DOCUMENTATION.md`
4. Add test in `backend/test_complete.py` or `test_endpoints_manual.ps1`

## Chat pipeline order (`chat.py`)
Classify → risk check → emotion/sentiment → LLM → exercise (skip if crisis) → `create_chat_log`

## Crisis
- Never skip `RiskDetector` before LLM
- If `is_crisis`, return helplines and do not assign exercises

## DB
- Use `db_service.get_db()` / `execute_one` — no raw SQL in routes
- SQLite dev: `USE_SQLITE=true` in `.env`

## ML models
- Classifier requires `backend/models/*.joblib` — run `python scripts/train_model.py` if missing
